@baseUrl = http://localhost:5204

### Create Jane Doe's first astronaut duty
POST {{baseUrl}}/AstronautDuty
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "rank": "Captain",
  "dutyTitle": "Pilot",
  "dutyStartDate": "2026-11-01"
}

### Retrieve Jane Doe's astronaut duties
GET {{baseUrl}}/AstronautDuty/Jane%20Doe

### Person must already exist
POST {{baseUrl}}/AstronautDuty
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Unknown Person",
  "rank": "Captain",
  "dutyTitle": "Pilot",
  "dutyStartDate": "2026-11-01"
}
